    <compactLayoutAssignment>SYSTEM</compactLayoutAssignment>
    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>Contacts and Prospects can be added to campaigns, as campaign members. To store the relationship between those campaign members, their related campaign and account (client) a new custom object was created (related campaigns).
When a contact or a prospect that is being converted is inserted in campaign members, a new record in the custom object would be created.</description>
